{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.81961059570312,
        204.859375,
        97.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Treatment adherence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.5631103515625,
        513.4260864257812,
        118.91461181640625
      ],
      "text": "Children, their parents, other family members and other caregivers should be educated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.55963134765625,
        513.3916015625,
        134.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "about TB and the importance of completing treatment. The support of the child’s parents",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.55615234375,
        513.40283203125,
        150.90765380859375
      ],
      "text": "and immediate family is vital to ensure a satisfactory outcome of treatment. Often a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.55267333984375,
        513.4375,
        166.9041748046875
      ],
      "text": "health care worker can observe or administer treatment but, if this arrangement is not",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        169.5491943359375,
        513.448974609375,
        182.90069580078125
      ],
      "text": "convenient for the family, a trained community member (preferably someone other than",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        185.54571533203125,
        513.3800048828125,
        198.897216796875
      ],
      "text": "the child’s parent or immediate family) can assume this responsibility. All children should",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        201.542236328125,
        513.4260864257812,
        214.89373779296875
      ],
      "text": "receive treatment free of charge. Whenever possible, FDCs of drugs should be used to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        217.53875732421875,
        513.46044921875,
        230.8902587890625
      ],
      "text": "simplify drug administration and adherence. Patient treatment cards are recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        233.5352783203125,
        276.3073425292969,
        246.88677978515625
      ],
      "text": "for documenting treatment adherence.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        258.04180908203125,
        513.3685302734375,
        271.393310546875
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to the full course of therapy is frequently a challenge, especially as clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        274.038330078125,
        513.380126953125,
        287.38983154296875
      ],
      "text": "improvement can be rapid; most children with TB will start to show signs of improvement",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        290.03485107421875,
        270.75286865234375,
        303.3863525390625
      ],
      "text": "after 2-4 weeks of anti-TB treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        314.54132080078125,
        513.4603881835938,
        327.892822265625
      ],
      "text": "On assessment at 2 months after the start of treatment, the possibility of treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        330.5378112792969,
        441.3899230957031,
        343.8893127441406
      ],
      "text": "failure should be considered if a child who is receiving anti-TB treatment:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        352.875,
        396.98394775390625,
        366.34149169921875
      ],
      "text": "has no symptom resolution or has worsening symptoms; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        372.34429931640625,
        264.92938232421875,
        385.810791015625
      ],
      "text": "shows continued weight loss; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        392.4136047363281,
        240.6068572998047,
        405.8800964355469
      ],
      "text": "is sputum smear-positive -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        414.08282470703125,
        513.4030151367188,
        427.434326171875
      ],
      "text": "Poor adherence is a common cause of “treatment failure”. Treatment failure suggests",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        430.0793151855469,
        513.4949340820312,
        443.4308166503906
      ],
      "text": "the possibility of MDR-TB and needs careful assessment (Chapter 7). It may also be more",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.0758056640625,
        321.90484619140625,
        459.42730712890625
      ],
      "text": "common in children living with HIV (Chapter 6).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        473.2433166503906,
        308.8393859863281,
        487.46331787109375
      ],
      "text": "Treatment issues specific to adolescents",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        495.9178161621094,
        513.4375610351562,
        509.33831787109375
      ],
      "text": "(8) The treatment of TB in adolescents follows the same guidelines as for adults  . As",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        511.98333740234375,
        513.4146118164062,
        525.3348388671875
      ],
      "text": "regards dosage requirements, risk of MDR-TB, and drug tolerance, adolescents show",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        527.9797973632812,
        513.3800048828125,
        541.331298828125
      ],
      "text": "greater similarity to adults than to young children. Thus, it is recommended that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        543.9762573242188,
        513.3912353515625,
        557.3277587890625
      ],
      "text": "adolescents and older children (once they reach a body weight of 25 kg) be treated at",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        559.9727783203125,
        315.1083679199219,
        573.3242797851562
      ],
      "text": "adult dosages, as further discussed in Annex 5.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        584.4793090820312,
        513.4259643554688,
        597.830810546875
      ],
      "text": "Adolescents are at particular risk for poor adherence, which can be exacerbated by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        600.4757690429688,
        513.3570556640625,
        613.8272705078125
      ],
      "text": "the unique challenges for this age group of access to, and support from, either child",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        616.4722900390625,
        513.3799438476562,
        629.8237915039062
      ],
      "text": "health services or adult health services when they are often seen as belonging to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        632.4688110351562,
        513.4375610351562,
        645.8203125
      ],
      "text": "neither. Treating adolescents with TB requires that special attention be paid to ensuring",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        648.4652709960938,
        513.4489135742188,
        661.8167724609375
      ],
      "text": "adherence. Involving adolescents in their care may help to engage them as active",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        664.4617919921875,
        513.3915405273438,
        677.8132934570312
      ],
      "text": "participants in their treatment plan. For example, individualized and family counselling",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        680.4583129882812,
        513.4489135742188,
        693.809814453125
      ],
      "text": "and “brainstorming” on adherence strategies may empower adolescents and motivate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        696.454833984375,
        229.01937866210938,
        709.8063354492188
      ],
      "text": "them to adhere to treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        723.651123046875,
        232.39938354492188,
        737.87109375
      ],
      "text": "Other management issues",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        746.3256225585938,
        161.06588745117188,
        759.74609375
      ],
      "text": "Corticosteroids",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        770.901123046875,
        513.4030151367188,
        784.2526245117188
      ],
      "text": "Corticosteroids may be used for the management of some complicated forms of TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        786.8976440429688,
        513.3798828125,
        800.2491455078125
      ],
      "text": "e.g. tuberculous meningitis, complications of airway obstruction by TB lymph glands,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "39",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}